WEBVTT

01:08:29.871 --> 01:08:33.704
a collection of podcasts dedicated
to sparking curiosity

01:08:33.704 --> 01:08:35.246
and sharing ideas that matter.

01:08:36.038 --> 01:08:41.829
This show is produced by Kim Net2Phone
Pittas and edited by Grace Rubenstein

01:08:41.829 --> 01:08:44.996
and Sheila Boffano, Sambor Islamic Sir.

01:08:45.454 --> 01:08:49.121
Fact Check is by Paul Durbin and special
thanks to Michele Quent,

01:08:49.204 --> 01:08:55.246
Colin Helmes and Anna Felin. If you like
the show, please write and review it.

01:08:55.663 --> 01:08:57.288
It helps other people find us.

01:08:57.496 --> 01:09:02.454
We read every review, so thanks so much
for listening. See you next time.